ype_level, model_level, config_level), recommendation, test_reports.\n\nDouble-check numbers: 10,000 → 10000; 1,000 → 1000. -10°C to +40°C → min -10, max 40. 85–1100 Ω. 1 µV. -9.7 mV to 19.5 mV. 0–10 mV. 9-12 VDC. 9V/500mA. 6V/4Ah. 5 VDC. 30 m. V1.2. P_ind = 0.5.\n\nMax scale intervals config: 10000 Class III, 1000 Class IIII.\n\nlcd attribute name: \"lcd_display_size\" unit \"in\".\n\nWrite it out.",
